sequenceDiagram
    participant Student as Student Red Workspace
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant Backend as FastAPI WebSocket
    participant Kali as Kali Session Container
    participant Target as Scenario Target
    participant Filebeat as Filebeat
    participant ES as Elasticsearch
    participant Blue as Blue Team Workspace
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AI as AI Provider or Fallback

    Student->>Frontend: Submit terminal command
    Frontend->>Backend: WebSocket stdin frame
    Backend->>DB: Store command metadata
    Backend->>AI: Send bounded/redacted context when allowed
    AI-->>Backend: Socratic hint or fallback hint
    Backend->>Kali: Proxy PTY input through Docker exec
    Kali->>Target: Interact inside isolated scenario network
    Target-->>Filebeat: Emit service/security logs
    Filebeat->>ES: Forward logs
    Backend->>ES: Poll/query matching telemetry
    Backend->>DB: Persist SIEM event and evidence metadata
    Backend-->>Frontend: WebSocket stdout, hint, output insight, event
    Frontend-->>Student: Render terminal output and guidance
    Backend-->>Blue: SIEM event stream
    Blue->>DB: Save triage notes and classifications

